WEBVTT

0
00:00:01.018 --> 00:00:01.450
Next,

1
00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:04.840
let's review the process for creating a prospective member record,

2
00:00:05.219 --> 00:00:09.300
which you'll use to create a case for your interaction with an unknown caller.

3
00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:14.989
To create a prospective member record,

4
00:00:15.409 --> 00:00:18.549
navigate to the prospective members button on the home screen.

5
00:00:20.129 --> 00:00:22.290
In the new prospective member pop-up,

6
00:00:22.799 --> 00:00:24.389
complete all required fields.

7
00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:30.149
Type unknown for all text entry fields such as first and last name,

8
00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:31.370
street and city.

9
00:00:42.689 --> 00:00:46.639
Type zeros for numeric fields such as the zip code and phone number.

10
00:00:51.299 --> 00:00:52.880
And choose PA for the state,

11
00:00:53.419 --> 00:00:54.840
then click save.

12
00:00:55.220 --> 00:00:57.840
A new prospective member record will appear.